        "Welcome to Wikipedia",
        "266,550 active editors",
        "7,245,818 articles in English",
        "From today's featured article",
        "\"The Long and Winding Road\" is a song by the Beatles from their 1970 album Let It Be. A piano ballad, Paul McCartney (pictured) composed the song in 1968 at his farm in Scotland. He was driven by the Beatles' growing bitterness towards each other. Main recording was done in January 1969 as part of t",
